 That day, for no particular reason, I decided to go for a little route. So I
 routed to the end of the ethernet cable. And when I got there, I thought maybe
 I'd route to the end of the dishy. And when I got there, I thought maybe I'd
 just route across the satellites. And I figured, since I route this far, maybe
 I'd just route across the space lasers. And that's what I did. I routed clear
 across the Internet. For no particular reason I just kept on going. I routed
 clear to the old Club Penguin servers. And when I got there, I figured, since
 I'd gone this far, I might as well turn around, just keep on routing. When I
 got to a firewall, I figured, since I'd gone this far, I might as well just
 turn back, keep right on routing.

